# `plans/artifacts/` holds ~1.8 GB of raw sessions and replay output: local, and it
# does NOT travel with a clone. The ANALYSIS SCRIPTS and the hand-read dossiers in
# there are ~140 KB and are the METHOD behind every number in `.plan/` - task files
# cite them by path - so those are tracked and the bulk is not.
plans/**
!plans/artifacts/
!plans/artifacts/**/
!plans/artifacts/**/*.py
!plans/artifacts/**/*.md
plans/artifacts/**/sessions/**
plans/artifacts/**/runs/**
plans/artifacts/**/blind_read/**
.deepcode/
unsloth_compiled_cache/
output/
output29/
scratchpad/
z_image_universal.log

